gevano."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 287, "end": 377, "text": "It is located 30 km south-southwest of that city, on the Staffora (a tributary of the Po)."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 378, "end": 491, "text": "It is the main town of Oltrepò Pavese, and is an important rail and road hub as well as a renowned wine producer."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d03", "start": 492, "end": 555, "text": "Known in ancient times as Iria, the town took its name from the"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 0, "end": 77, "text": "This is an underground sight , so we did not visit it – I am claustrophobic !"}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 78, "end": 181, "text": "On a side street alongside the bar is an unimpressive door which you can open onto the Ipogeo Celtico ."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 182, "end": 264, "text": "This is a series of rock chambers , or grottoes , carved close to the cliff face ."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 265, "end": 325, "text": "No-one knows how old the caves are , who dug them , or why ."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 326, "end": 433, "text": "As the name suggests , some think this is a pre-Roman Celtic site , perhaps intended for burials or rites ."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d04", "start": 434, "end": 499, "text": "Longobard Temple Continuing along Via Monastero Maggiore from the"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0192-b3372c1e155b:d00:c0", "entity": "Forum Iulii", "scope": "region", "claim": "Forum Iulii is a town in the Friuli-Venezia Giulia 